WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:11.150
58. Dr. Bronner Soaps Dr. Bronner Soaps is a company that makes a

2
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:17.830
variety of soaps. It was founded in 1948, and members of the Bronner family still run

3
00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:24.510
the business. Though Dr. Bronner's may seem like any other company, the business is actually

4
00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:33.030
rather unusual. First, Dr. Bronner's believes in fair business practices and giving back.

5
00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:39.150
It says that, over the past five years, it has donated almost as much money to charity

6
00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:46.350
as it has earned in profits. The company also limits executive salaries. That means that

7
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.590
the highest paid employees of the company can only earn up to five times the amount

8
00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:57.470
of the lowest paid employees. Therefore, the difference between the highest earners and

9
00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:04.910
the lowest earners is minimized. This is an uncommon rule for a company to have.

10
00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:10.830
Dr. Bronner's likes to work fairly around the world, too. For that reason, Dr. Bronner's

11
00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:16.430
became a certified fair trade business. This means the supplies it gets from around the

12
00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:23.990
world come from farmers or other workers who are paid fairly and work under good conditions.

13
00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:29.870
Finally, the founder of the company believed deeply that all living things on earth should

14
00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:36.910
be united. To spread his message, the company printed his beliefs on the labels of his soaps.

15
00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:45.710
His ideas are still on every soap-bottle label. They can be summed up in two sentences. One,

16
00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:50.590
constructive capitalism is where you share the profits with the workers and the earth.

17
00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:56.190
Two, we are all brothers and sisters, and we should take care of each other and the earth.

18
00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:01.990
Dr. Bronner's soaps beliefs making money and doing good should go hand in hand.

19
00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:08.910
While this is not a typical business belief, Dr. Bronner's proves that a company can be

20
00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:15.350
successful and charitable. After all, its philosophy has been working for over 60 years.
